OL,3,AFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Apreparing terrorist act after major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men have been arrested and remain
OL,8,Fin custody as counter-terror police are
OL,9,Fleading an investigation into a major
OL,10,Fincident near RAF Fairford
OL,12,FThey were arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fcommitting offences under the
OL,14,FExplosives Act, and have been further
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of preparation of
OL,16,Fa terrorist act
OL,18,FGloucestershire Police say the force
OL,19,Freceived a call at about 00:45 BST on
OL,20,FSunday morning relating to "three
OL,21,Fsuspicious vehicles" travelling towards
OL,22,Fthe RAF base
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
