OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Apreparing terrorist act after major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a news conference, Assistant Chief
OL,8,FConstable Richard Ocone says "work to
OL,9,Festablish the full nature of the
OL,10,Fincident is ongoing", as 85 homes have
OL,11,Fbeen evacuated
OL,13,FHelicopter footage shows robots
OL,14,Fapproaching vans at the scene as a
OL,15,FBritish Army bomb disposal team is
OL,16,Fcarrying out operations
OL,18,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,19,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,20,Fmilitary. The country's Air Force says
OL,21,Fit "remains vigilant" following the
OL,22,Fincident
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
