OL,3,A'Scourge' of abuse must be rooted out,
OL,4,Asays Pope, during Lourdes visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo has called on French bishops
OL,7,Fto root out the "scourge" of sexual
OL,8,Fabuse in the Roman Catholic church,
OL,9,Ftelling them to "maintain the greatest
OL,10,Fvigilance", ahead of a meeting with
OL,11,Fabuse survivors.
OL,13,FThe Pope delivered the message to
OL,14,Fbishops during a private meeting at the
OL,15,FSanctuary of Our Holy Lady of Lourdes,
OL,16,Fa holy site in southern France, on the
OL,17,Fthird day of his four-day official
OL,18,Fvisit to France.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
